invalid type: string "TOPIC: TRAVEL TIPS\nSOURCE: Travel Guide for Nepal\n\nTRAVEL TIPS\nIn Nepal, the forehead is regarded as the most sacred part of the body and it’s impolite to touch an\nadult Nepali’s head.\nThe cow is considered a Universal Mother, symbolizing motherhood, charity, and pity. The slaughter of\ncows is illegal in Nepal.\nh taxi, private car, and city bus.", expected a boole